      "type": "tool",
      "slug": "claude-code",
      "title": "Claude Code",
      "summary": "终端里的编码代理，主力工具。插件、Skill、Hook、MCP 都挂在它上面。",
      "status": "using",
      "pinned": true,
      "rating": 5,
