      ],
      "tags": [
        "CLI",
        "编码代理"
      ],
      "fields": {
        "类别": "CLI 编码代理",
        "配置目录": "~/.claude/",
        "费用": "订阅或 API 计费"
      },
      "snippets": [
        {
          "id": "hp431a3p",
          "label": "安装（Windows 原生）",
          "lang": "powershell",
          "code": "irm https://claude.ai/install.ps1 | iex",
          "install": true
        },
        {
          "id": "gcbh47cc",
          "label": "安装（npm）",
          "lang": "bash",
          "code": "npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code",
          "install": false
        },
        {
          "id": "g6jbf699",
          "label": "查看已装 MCP",
          "lang": "bash",
          "code": "claude mcp list",
          "install": false
        }
      ],
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "官方文档",
          "url": "https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/claude-code/overview"
        }
      ],
      "body": "## 使用习惯\n\n- 全局规则写在 `~/.codex/AGENTS.md`，`~/.claude/CLAUDE.md` 只放一行 `@~/.codex/AGENTS.md` 引用，两个工具共用一份。\n- 大任务先进 plan 模式，确认后再动手。\n\n## 新机器检查\n\n1. 装好 Node 与 Git\n2. 安装 Claude Code\n3. 按本环境的“安装清单”装插件和 MCP",
